NAME
       useradd - create a user account

SYNOPSIS
       useradd [-u uid] [-s shell] [-G sudo] <name>

DESCRIPTION
       Creates an account, its home directory and its passwd entry. Set
       a password afterwards with passwd.

OPTIONS
       -u N       use this numeric id
       -s SHELL   login shell
       -G sudo    also make the account a sudoer

EXAMPLES
       useradd -G sudo alice
       passwd alice

SEE ALSO
       userdel(1), usermod(1), passwd(1), groups(1)
